1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,132
Two hundred suppliers reply to an RFQ.

2
00:00:03,634 --> 00:00:07,358
PDFs, spreadsheets, prices buried in emails.

3
00:00:07,888 --> 00:00:10,485
Today, that's hours of manual entry.

4
00:00:10,967 --> 00:00:12,419
Now, one prompt.

5
00:00:13,004 --> 00:00:14,668
Claude reads every reply in

6
00:00:14,668 --> 00:00:16,518
Outlook with read-only access,

7
00:00:16,895 --> 00:00:18,965
enters the data into our Excel template,

8
00:00:19,278 --> 00:00:21,027
flags any notes or errors,

9
00:00:21,302 --> 00:00:23,380
and gets it ready for CM integration.

10
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:25,538
You get a folder that's ready

11
00:00:25,538 --> 00:00:27,170
to integrate straight into CM,

12
00:00:27,488 --> 00:00:29,315
and a report that flags what needs

13
00:00:29,315 --> 00:00:31,034
a human eye for a further check.

14
00:00:31,598 --> 00:00:32,781
Hours of data entry

15
00:00:32,781 --> 00:00:34,338
become minutes of review.

16
00:00:34,882 --> 00:00:36,404
All by using Claude Code

17
00:00:36,404 --> 00:00:38,242
to automate repeat processes.

